rations information, visit fly.faa.gov, and follow @FAANews on Twitter for the latest news and Air Traffic Alerts.\nTitle: Live Airline Flight Cancellations Info & Statistics - FlightAware\nURL: https://www.flightaware.com/live/cancelled\nContent: Real-time cancellation statistics and flight tracker links for cancelled airline flights. View top cancellations by airline or airport.\n\n## Results for query: impact of recent disruptions on flight schedules\nTitle: US Faces New Travel Chaos as Air Canada, Air France, United, British ...\nURL: https://www.travelandtourworld.com/news/article/us-faces-new-travel-chaos-as-air-canada-air-france-united-british-ethiopian-lufthansa-emirates-and-other-airlines-face-over-1700-flight-delays-including-at-chicago-ohare-airport-what/\nContent: The Broader Impact of Delays Across the US Although Chicago O\'Hare is at the center of today\'s disruption, the effects are being felt far beyond Illinois. 1,720 flight delays have been reported across the country, affecting flights in and out of key airports.\nTitle: Over 900 Flights Canceled and Delayed as Severe Storms Batter Major US ...\nURL: https://boltflight.com/over-900-flights-canceled-and-delayed-as-severe-storms-batter-major-us-hubs-during-peak-summer-travel/\nContent: Torrential thunderstorms and violent wind systems have unleashed widespread chaos across major U.S. airports, triggering over 900 flight cancellations and delays and throwing the summer travel season into disarray. The June 19 disruption hit key carriers such as Air Canada, American, United, Delta, Alaska, Spirit, and Frontier, and impacted aviation hubs including JFK, Newark, Philadelphia\nTitle: Disruption as airlines cancel flights and reroute planes to avoid ...\nURL: https://www.cnn.com/2025/06/13/travel/airline-disruption-israel-iran-strike-intl-scli\nContent: Global air traffic has been disrupted following Israel\'s strikes on Iran Friday, with several major airlines suspending flights to and from locations in the Middle East and rerouting their\nTitle: Over 400 Flights Canceled at Atlanta Airport Due to Severe Weather\nURL: https://www.visaverge.com/news/over-400-flights-canceled-at-atlanta-airport-due-to-severe-weather/\nContent: Severe thunderstorms and hail on June 27, 2025, caused over 400 flight cancellations and 600 delays at Atlanta\'s Hartsfield-Jackson airport. Delta inspected 100 aircraft for hail damage, while the FAA briefly evacuated the control tower. These disruptions amid holiday travel caused nationwide ripple effects and ongoing recovery challenges.\nTitle: Impact of Real-Time Flight Regulations on Travel Plans\nURL: https://wowfare.com/blog/real-time-flight-regulations-how-updates-impact-your-travel-plans/\nContent: Discover how real-time flight regulations influence your travel plans and stay updated to avoid disruptions and ensure a smooth journey.', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'o4-mini', 'stream': False}}
